10.1186/1471-2156-8-79</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science, and Technology (MEXT) Integrated Database Project</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://lifesciencedb.mext.go.jp/en/"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>